[38;2;124;124;124mThe problem asks: Let $k$ be either $\mathbb{C}$ or $\mathbb{R}$. Let $X$ be a [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mquasi-projective smooth algebraic variety over $k$. Consider $X(k)$ with the [0m
